Stardew Valley Expanded adds new Quests and Special Orders. If you are using one of the mod's included [[Farm Maps]], additional quests will be added. For more information about the mechanics of Quests and Special orders, see [[Stardew:Quests|Quests]] on main Stardew wiki.

{{TOC}}


